  "textSample": "ascii-reveal\nv0.3 · open source\nGitHub\nNew\nA loading effect for React\nYour skeleton loader is boring us to death.\n\nNobody has ever enjoyed a pulsing gray rectangle. ascii-reveal decodes your real content into place, glyph by glyph, so the wait looks like something is actually happening.\n\nSee it in action\n↓\n$ npm i ascii-reveal\nCopy\nPRESET\nDecode\nDither\nTerminal\nBlueprint\nWAVE FROM\nCenter\nCorner\nCursor\nSPEED\n1.0×\nReplay\nR\n\nClick a card to replay it from that point\n\nRedeploy runs the loading → loaded cycle\n\nQuan Hoang\n\nDesigner & UX/UI Engineer\n\nDesigns and builds interfaces where motion explain"
